Read `.cursor/skills/desk-motion/SKILL.md` before adding movement.

Only pending, live, land, shift, press. Reuse `pendingSpinnerClass`, `LivePing`, `DeskLandScope`, `DeskLandSurface`, `deskShiftClass`, `DeskNotice`. Map by surface type (shell, list, detail, notice, modal, state, empty, numbers, form, route). `prefers-reduced-motion` kills live ping, land wash, landing rise/drift, pending spinner, shift, and notice enter/exit.
